{"ref":"BDB, צַ֫יִד²","hw":"צַ֫יִד²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צַ֫יִד</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>provision, food</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָ֑יִד</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵידוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:41\" href=\"/Job.38.41\">Jb 38:41</a>, etc.;—<em>provision</em> taken on journey <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:14\" href=\"/Joshua.9.14\">Jos 9:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם צֵידָם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">5</a> (both JE); more gen. (late), <em>food, food-supply</em>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:15\" href=\"/Psalms.132.15\">ψ 132:15</a>, of raven <a data-ref=\"Job 38:41\" href=\"/Job.38.41\">Jb 38:41</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַיִד</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_צוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">צוד</a>.","next":"BDB, צֵידָה","prev":"BDB, צוד"}